    "title": "New Zealand bond demand hits decade high post-election, yields fall",
    "summary": "Increased investor confidence post-election may enhance New Zealand's fiscal stability, influencing future economic policies and market dynamics.\nThe post New Zealand bond demand hits decade high post-election, yields fall appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
